# Quote form delivery (optional).
#
# The live Formspree form ID ships as the default in src/lib/forms.ts, so the
# form works without setting anything here. Set this only to point a preview
# or local build at a different form — for example a throwaway one so test
# submissions don't reach the business inbox.
#
# The ID is the part after /f/ in the endpoint:
#   https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz  ->  abcdwxyz
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
